&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical direction and architecture of the Lending &amp;amp; Savings platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable, secure, and highly available distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make key architectural decisions balancing scalability, performance, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on, contributing production-quality code and reviewing critical changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive engineering best practices across system design, testing, deployment, observability, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through code reviews, technical coaching, and day-to-day leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of technical initiatives from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Business Lead and designers to translate product requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down complex initiatives into clear engineering milestones and execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks early and propose pragmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure services remain resilient, performant, and secure as the platform scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Lending &amp;amp; Savings Business Lead to understand customer problems and product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical input into product planning, helping shape solutions that balance customer value, engineering complexity, and delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Design, Treasury, Trading, Risk, Compliance, and Infrastructure teams to build customer-focused solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving user journeys, performance, and platform reliability through continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a small team of engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help recruit exceptional engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise engineering standards across code quality, documentation, testing, and operational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve engineering productivity through automation and modern development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of AI-assisted engineering tools where they improve developer efficiency while maintaining high standards for quality and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement across architecture, tooling, and engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
